pmp:NewThoughtShinnChooseWordsWhichBringAFlash a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Choosing words which bring a flash of fulfillment"@en, "Worte wählen, die ein Aufblitzen der Erfüllung bringen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Using affirmations whose words (like 'crammed, jammed') call up a vivid picture of the demand fulfilled."@en ;
    skos:note "Author's term: \"choose words which bring a flash of the fulfillment\"."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnYourWordIsYourWand ;
