    rdfs:label "Working according to the Divine Design"@en, "Im Einklang mit dem göttlichen Plan wirken"@de ;
    skos:definition "The state of a student whose demands follow the Divine Idea rather than a self-made picture."@en ;
    skos:note "Author's term: \"working according to the Divine Design\"."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a capacity: a state the text holds attainable."@en ;
