pmc:NewThoughtShinnPerfectFaithInGodYieldsUndisturbedByAdverseAppearances a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Perfect faith yields being undisturbed by adverse appearances"@en, "Vollkommener Glaube macht unbeirrbar gegen widrigen Anschein"@de ;
    skos:definition "Perfect faith in an invincible protecting power is said to leave a person undisturbed by adverse appearances, knowing that Infinite Intelligence protects his interests."@en ;
