pmc:NewThoughtShinnResentmentHasRuinedMoreHomes a pm:Cautioning ;
    rdfs:label "Resentment is more ruinous than drink or war"@en, "Groll zerstört mehr als Trunk und Krieg"@de ;
    skos:definition "Resentment is warned against as having ruined more homes than drink and killed more people than war."@en ;
    pm:cautionsAbout pmc:NewThoughtShinnHappinessAndHealth ;
    skos:note "Author's term: \"Resentment has ruined more homes than drink\"."@en ;
