pmc:NewThoughtShinnHateAndResentmentCausedHardStones a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Resentment as cause of illness (gall-stones)"@en, "Groll als Ursache von Krankheit (Gallensteine)"@de ;
    skos:definition "A woman's resentment over an inheritance made her lose weight, unable to work, develop gall-stones and fall ill."@en ;
    skos:note "Author's term: \"hate and resentment\"."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a failure condition: the text names an outcome that goes wrong or does not come, and its cause. It names how pmc:NewThoughtShinnHappinessAndHealth fails."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:thirdPartyAscription ;
