pmc:NewThoughtShinnOnlyForgivenessCanCure a pm:Presupposing ;
    rdfs:label "Forgiveness before healing of resentment-born illness"@en, "Vergebung vor der Heilung grollbedingter Krankheit"@de ;
    skos:definition "Illness formed by hate and resentment can be cured only by forgiveness and good-will."@en ;
