    pm:priorStep pmp:NewThoughtShinnForgivenessAndGoodWill ;
    pm:prerequisiteStrength pm:statedNecessity ;
    pm:consequenceOfSkipping "Without forgiveness the hate and resentment keep forming hard stones in the body." ;
