pmc:NewThoughtShinnAHopeChestAndNotAFaithChest a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "A Hope Chest rather than a Faith Chest"@en, "Eine Hoffnungstruhe statt einer Glaubenstruhe"@de ;
    skos:definition "Women who prepare Hope Chests do not marry because they hope rather than believe."@en ;
    skos:note "Author's term: \"a Hope Chest and not a Faith Chest\"."@en ;
