pmc:NewThoughtShinnNeutralizeTheBelief a pm:Presupposing ;
    rdfs:label "Neutralizing the belief of debt before conditions change"@en, "Den Schuldenglauben neutralisieren, bevor sich die Lage ändert"@de ;
    skos:definition "The belief of debt must be neutralized in order to change the outer condition."@en ;
