pmc:NewThoughtShinnTheThingYouDislikeOrHate a pm:Cautioning ;
    rdfs:label "What you hate will come upon you"@en, "Was man hasst, kommt über einen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Hating something makes a vivid picture in the subconscious that objectifies, so the hated thing comes."@en ;
    pm:cautionsAbout pmc:NewThoughtShinnSubconsciousMind ;
    skos:note "Author's term: \"The thing you dislike or hate will surely come upon you\"."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnYourWordIsYourWand ;
