    rdfs:label "Non-resistance as the only way to erase hate pictures"@en, "Nicht-Widerstand als einziger Weg, Hassbilder zu löschen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Hate pictures can only be erased through non-resistance; otherwise the hated thing keeps coming."@en ;
