pmc:NewThoughtShinnJealousAndResentful a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Jealousy and resentment drive away the loved one"@en, "Eifersucht und Groll vertreiben den Geliebten"@de ;
    skos:definition "A woman jealous of a man's cousins lost him; the same cousins appeared with the next man."@en ;
    skos:note "Author's term: \"She was jealous and resentful\"."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a failure condition: the text names an outcome that goes wrong or does not come, and its cause. It names how pmc:NewThoughtShinnUnhappyExperiencesNotRepeated fails."@en ;
