pmc:NewThoughtShinnReapingOnTheExternal a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Man reaps on the external what he has sown in his thought world"@en, "Der Mensch erntet im Äußeren, was er in seiner Gedankenwelt gesät hat"@de ;
