pmp:NewThoughtShinnGodWasHerImmediateSupply a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Affirming God as one's immediate supply while walking"@en, "Beim Gehen Gott als unmittelbare Versorgung bejahen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Repeating, in need, that God is one's immediate supply."@en ;
