pmc:NewThoughtShinnIDecidedICouldnTAffordIt a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Ignoring a hunch for reasons of cost blocks the demonstration"@en, "Eine Eingebung aus Kostengründen zu übergehen blockiert die Demonstration"@de ;
    skos:definition "The room stayed unrented for weeks while the client declined her hunch to buy a lamp."@en ;
    skos:note "Author's term: \"I decided I couldn't afford it\"."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a failure condition: the text names an outcome that goes wrong or does not come, and its cause. It names how pmc:NewThoughtShinnTheRightAndPerfectMan fails."@en ;
