pmc:NewThoughtShinnChooseTheAffirmationWhichAppealsToYouYieldsChangeAnUnhappyCondition a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Choosing the affirmation that appeals most and waving it over the situation brings power to change an unhappy condition"@en, "Die ansprechendste Affirmation wählen und über die Lage schwingen bewirkt: Macht, eine unglückliche Lage zu wandeln"@de ;
    skos:definition "The text holds that choosing the affirmation that appeals most and waving it over the situation brings this about: power to change an unhappy condition."@en ;
